Title: Pain
Author: (from Pain_FD_4_scenes.pdf)

EXT/INT. HOSPITAL - NIGHT

Ambulance siren, hospital env. Siddhu's been rushed to a hospital. Alaa Siddhu kallu moosthadu.

CUT TO:

2 MONTHS LATER

EXT. OPEN PARK - MAGIC HOUR

Doctor will be looking at Siddhu, walks along with Rishi

DOCTOR
Rishi, ippativarku Siddharth unconscious unnadani cheppaledu
(points out Siddhu)
head injury valla, lost his sense of feeling pain, Hypoalgesia antaaru

Siddhu alaa nilchoni chusthuntaadu, harsh sun ni hand tho avoid chesthuntadu. Rishi alaa blank chusthu Doc ni

RISHI
Enti?

Ani Siddhu ni chusthunte, Siddhu mellaga sun light ni theeskuntu untadu on his face

DOCTOR (O.S.)
Noppi ni process chese Nerves damage avvadam valla ala avthundi

RISHI (O.S.)
ante vaadu, noppi ni feel avvaledu antunnara?

Doc nods

DOCTOR
Both Physically and Emotionally. Ante shaareerakanga, maanasikanga kuda--

Rishi interrupts by staring at unknown

DOCTOR (CONT'D)
Body ki emaina debhalu thagilina

DOCTOR (CONT'D)
(shakes a no)
feel avvaleru

Doc ala chepthunte, Rishi, Siddhu ni chusthuntaadu(walks)

RISHI
Ilaa enduk indho telid kaani
Accident maatram vaadi manchike indhi ankunta
(as he takes a deep breath)

Sidhdhu will be observing, walking around, as if he feels new all these around, kind of feels different. Siddhu chusthu, walks towards Rishi-doc as they speak.

Doc will be smoking, Rishi will be looking at Doc with a blank-dull face, as Siddhu approaches, shakes hand with doc

DOCTOR
Take care Siddharth

CUT TO:

As they walk

SIDDHARTH
Emantunnad ra Doc?

Rishi alaane chusthu Siddhu ni, Shakes a no, shoulder meedha cheyyi vesi with a gentle smile

RISHI
Dhaa cheptha

On bike, as they drive away.

WHITE FLASH CUT:

TWO MONTHS EARLIER

EXT. ROAD-SIDE - NIGHT

A guy staring at unknown deeply, takes up a puff, unaware of the surroundings, having a beer. 2 people, across a shop, at certain distance, as they light up a cigar, one of them saw him, walks towards him

GOON ONE
Goon_one takes a sip

GOON_ONE (CONT'D)
Betting la paisal anni
(with a sarcastic smile)

Does a gesture(Thumb-little finger), conveying that Rahul has lost it. Rahul with a blank stare, tries to take a puff, Goon_two takes a puff by holding Rahul's hand. Then Goon_two rests his hand on Rahul's shoulder, looking at him. As he releases the smoke, look into his eyes

GOON_TWO
Rendu rojul

as he stares

GOON_TWO (CONT'D)
Paisal ready chesko

vellipothaadu Goon_two, Goone_one laughs, nods sarcastically as if Rahul's already in trouble.

Rahul as he sips, stares at unknown without a blink.

MATCH CUT TO: (EYES OF RAHUL)

INT. SIDDHU'S HOUSE - CONTINUOUS

Siddharth, floor meeda kurchoni with a pad on his lap. There are different pencils, an eraser, a sharpener, a whole unit of box a side, all placed on the floor randomly, as he's sketching some cartoon character. Comic sketches on A4 sheets placed on one another with numbers visible at the bottom right circled.

A guy walks with random foot steps, and lands his foot on one of the A4 papers. Siddharth immediately looks at that feet with a shock, the guy picks up that paper with his toe, Siddharth looks up to him.

Holding that paper in front of his face, burns a comic character's face, his single eye is visible through the hole made by that cigar's burn. With a side smile, releases smoke, his face through an X mark which is being made on the paper is visible. And that paper is dropped, revealing his face. As he releases smokes, it's Rahul.

Rahul will be on his bed, as he takes a puff, Sidhu looks at him, takes big puff, as he slants on the pillow, throws that cigar at Sidhu. Sidhu moves a side, 1-2 sparks fell over here and there, he covers his face, looks at him, as he looks around, the cigar's ash being fell over those few sheets of comic sketches and a hole is made on all those sheets.

As Siddhu looks at him with a teary eyes,

RAHUL
Light banchey!
(with an irritative base voice)

Siddhu kind of jerked, switches off the light immediately. While Hot red cigar is being visible as Siddhu's sorts his stuff.

DISSOLVE TO: (CIGAR REDNESS TO EARLY SUN RISE)

EXT. METRO - MORNING

Siddhu with a backpack, running on the stairs. Looking at clock, as train arrival is being heard, looks up towards the train, stares at an escalator, tries to step on it, steps down with a small panic, looks up as the train might leave. Doesnt know what to do.

CUT TO:

Running up the stairs. Inside the train, leaning on the single rod, staring at unknown.

MATCH CUT TO: (KID-SIDDHU'S FACE)

INT. KID SIDDHU'S HOUSE - NIGHT

Comic books chaduthu, siddhu page turn chesthuntadu. Appude door sound avthundi. Ventane comics pakkana pettesi, homework chesthuntadu

FATHER (O.S.)
Rey!
